# Optional. Everything has a safe default; this lab needs no tenant and holds no credential.
# The one shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path), read by every standalone app.
# This lab takes exactly one optional key from it (util.parseEnv, every other key is ignored):
# PTL_LAB_MODE=mock               # the only mode this lab has. live is refused with a message (no live provider)
# Per-run settings (shell, not the shared file; the shared file holds no port):
# PTL_PORT=6211                   # must be in 6200-6249
# PTL_BIND=127.0.0.1              # loopback only unless you set this on purpose (the container does)
# PTL_WORKSPACE=default           # workspace id, [a-z0-9-]{1,32}
# PTL_CUSTOMER_CONFIG=customer.config.json
